  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to your dream coastal retreat in Villa Lago, perfectly situated within the renowned Sandestin Golf and Beach Resort. This stunning Mediterranean-inspired 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom home offers the perfect blend of elegance, comfort, and resort-style living just two doors from the neighborhood pool. Step out back to enjoy serene, picturesque views from the porch—ideal for morning coffee or winding down after a beach day.<br><br>Meticulously maintained and beautifully styled with a coastal-chic design, this spacious retreat is ideal for families and groups.Open-Concept Living: The gourmet kitchen features granite countertops, a striking backsplash, and plenty of space for gathering. The open layout flows seamlessly into the dining and living areas, making it perfect for entertaining.<br><br>The Home:<br>*Primary Suite: King bed, bonus sitting area, walk-in closet, and a luxurious en suite bath.<br>*Upstairs Guest Suites (2): Each offers a king bed and private en suite bathroom for added comfort and privacy.<br>*Bunk Room (Main Level): Twin-over-full bunk bed with a full bathroom conveniently located just across the hall.<br><br>Resort Living at Its Finest-Spanning over 2,400 acres, the resort offers:<br>*Miles of biking and walking trails<br>*Championship golf courses<br>*Marina access<br>*Beach access<br>*Onsite dining, shopping, and entertainment<br><br>You’re just a short walk or cart ride to the vibrant Village of Baytowne Wharf, filled with shops, restaurants, nightlife, and family-friendly events. With two included golf carts, getting to the Wharf, marina, or beach is easy and fun for everyone.<br>Conveniently located between Destin and scenic Highway 30A communities like Seaside and Grayton Beach, you’ll have access to outlet shopping, golf, pickleball, water parks, spas, theaters, fishing charters, and countless coastal adventures.<br><br>Book now and enjoy Free Dolphin Cruise, Free Big Kahunas Waterpark entry, Free parasailing, Free Baytowne Adventure Zone, & Free Cruisin' Tiki Crab Island Cruise! One ticket is provided for each activity per day Not per person** They cannot be saved and combined. Activities are subject to availability and partners participation can change at any time. The Family Fun Package does not apply to stays that are longer than 28 nights.<br><br>Must be 25 years of age or older to rent.*All guest must abide by all home and HOA rules*<br>No Smoking. No Pets. Violators will be charged a fine of $500.A valid driver's license will be required for all person(s) over the age of 18 staying the the rental home. A copy of each guests insurance card must be provided also in order to operate the golf cart. Three days before arrival, a $500 golf cart deposit will be held. Any damage to the cart will be taken out of the deposit. If no damage, it will be released 5 days after departure.<br>Guest will also be required to sign a rental agreement with Coastline that will emailed to them in order to stay in the rental home. All information provided is deemed to be correct but is subject to change.<br><br>Property owner is not affiliated with, sponsored by or associated with any entity containing the word Sandestin®. Any use or reference to the word Sandestin® is used in the factual sense to geographically identify a property or location and not to suggest any affiliation with any SANDESTIN® branded entity, product or service.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
